    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kureeraá mibeeri tsár niwa waaraahhiyé' iimír Solomon Doó Mungú nee do'ós kuduú waawuti'iimaro ngiwa tleéhh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon gixsadudá' taa haniís nee Hiramu tleehharo gay /abeés, naagáy giri haniís dír múk Israeli as ngiwa hootiya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon gixsár Hamat-soba gay i haratláy, gari arbaá/ gay hayóh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gixsár Tadmori, tidár baraá xaanxaay, gay tleéhh. Gixsaduudá' xoosluuwós ngi babatsi giri tleéhh baraá Hamati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám Solomon gixsár Bet-horoni ar gawa nee Bet-horoni ar baraay gina tleéhh, gixsadudá' awa koo/i gawden nee afe nee tseegamooro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sleeme gixsár Balati gana tleéhh, nee didár xooslu ki babatsi, nee gixsár gaardu kudá' ta uuruxun nee faras, nee múk farasú i tsa/a/ama, nee umuúqo gaaro tidá' aa slaá' tleehharo baraá Yerusalemu, nee Lebanoni, nee baraá yaamuuwose, gay hhe'eés tleehharo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk hatlá' kudá' aa meet, mukduú Hiti, nee oo Amori, nee oo Perisi, nee oo Hifi nee oo Yebusi, kudaá múk Israeliwooká, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sleeme baraá tla/ángw xwaylar'ine múk taa hhaamiisiiká nee múk Israeli i deer, Solomon gina /uurutís baraá gadiyér tawa bihhií noongo'ootiiká. Tam ay laarí adoorí kan /imamiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Solomon múk Israeli gwa lawaale tleehhiiká as gadiyeérós, inooín an geeraharuusér slaqwaruuseerós, nee múk urén, nee an geeraharuusér gaardaá ta uuruxun nee faras, nee ar mukdá' faras gwa i tsa/ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharuusér uren ar waawutmo Solomon a tsiire tsár nee mibeeri kooán, kuká' an kudá' aleesleemuú koomá' daanduú muko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon hareerós, dasír waawutmo Farao, gana loohatís gixsár Daudi wa ale, gari huúw baraá do'odá' aa tleéhh as inós. Asma inós ina oó', «Harer'eé' i baraá doó waawutmo Daudi wa hotká, waawutmoó Israeli, asma didá' sandakmoó alqadór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i dirii'i ka hhoohhoo'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Solomon AAKOÓ MUNGÚ guri ilahhooár dá/tí haniís dír kitangwdá' aa tleéhh dír geeraá matla/ángw Doó Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilahhooarí gana haniís adoodá' hara'ayár Mose i kat, deelór Sabaáto, nee deelór slahhángw /abén birna ti'iít, nee deeloodá' uren tám baraá kurko: Deelór mikaátér taa sluuftisiiká, nee deelór uren ar fiiqit, nee deelór ur ar isleeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós adoodá' baabuúwós Daudi heé Mungú ngira hara'ayín gana eehár, baalaqaasír kaahamuusér Mungú ar umuú deelo gana qaás, nee ar mukduú tlahhoó Laáwi, kuduú kaahamuusér Mungú alee/iimiís as iwa xirfayemisiyá' nee gadiyér'ín ngiwa tleehhiya'. Xuumuuse sleeme gari qaás baraá bohhu umuúqo afkú do'o nguwa xuna'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamuusér Mungú nee múk tlahhoó Laáwi tidaádá' waawutmo ngaa báy kaa mayká tlehhtuuwo, daanduú doó ta xooslaárí babaatsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
